      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/modena_utah"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "One account says an Italian laborer named Modena after his hometown in Italy, while folklore suggests a Chinese cook's dinner call.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
